// Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dax/concatenatex-function-dax (example 1)
// Construct: An iterator with a string separator.
// Expect: parse
// Reference: accepts
// Normalized: as published, less the `Name =` that makes it a measure definition.
CONCATENATEX(Employees, [FirstName] & " " & [LastName], ",")
